$ map --help
usage: map  [--set KEY=VALUE [KEY=VALUE...]] [--help] [--markdown] [--version]


Optional switches:
   --set KEY=VALUE [KEY=VALUE...], -s KEY=VALUE [KEY=VALUE...]
    keys: cfl, nx, ny, t_end
    default value cfl=0.8
    Override input-deck parameters
   --help, -h
    Print this help message
   --markdown, -md
    Save this help message in a Markdown file
   --version, -v
    Print version
